          A no-effort response: no answer is attempted and no reasoning is shown.
          Nothing to mark or relate. Exclude from analysis with <c>confidence=3</c>.
          The exclusion is still recorded as a row with its rationale. The pair 
          R1/R6 marks the boundary between flag and exclude: an attempted answer without
          justification is flagged, while an explicit no-attempt is excluded.
        </p>
