    </exercise>
  </worksheet>

  <subsection xml:id="subsec-ws-01-readiness">
    <title>Blind Pass Readiness</title>
    <p>
      You are ready for the blind episode pass when you can:
      <ul>
          <li>state the project's <xref ref="g-evidence-boundary" text="title"/> accurately;</li>
          <li>identify <m>C</m>, <m>I</m>, and <m>J</m> without strengthening the response;</li>
          <li>distinguish operations from control structures;</li>
          <li>apply link status and completeness as separate decisions;</li>
          <li>recognize common incomplete and multi-episode cases;</li>
          <li>write concise evidence-based rationales; and</li>
          <li>identify uncertainty rather than conceal it.</li>
      </ul>
    </p>
  </subsection>

</section>